<title>USA: AMR Corp to cut Canadian fees by C$48 mln.</title>
<headline>AMR Corp to cut Canadian fees by C$48 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMR Corp said it will cut its service fees by C$48 million annually over four years to support Canadian Airlines' restructuring.</p>
<p>AMR, the parent of American Airlines, said the cut in fees to provide computer technology and administrative services to Canadian will not hurt its earnings.</p>
</text>
